        {"zh": "我抖了抖小身子", "en": "I shake my small body off"},
        {"zh": "再来一下我就跑", "en": "One more and I flee"},
        {"zh": "我低头舔着伤口", "en": "I lick the wound"},
        {"zh": "我还小，打不过你", "en": "I am small, I cannot win"}
